{"seq":25,"slug":"zig-language","title":"Zig 语言","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language","rating":{"composite":3.86,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"zig-语言\">Zig 语言</h1><p>Zig 把自己定位成「C 的现代替代品」，却又拒绝走 C++ 与 Rust 的路。它没有隐藏的内存分配、没有运算符重载、没有宏预处理器，甚至没有专门的泛型语法——所有这些能力都被折叠进一个统一的机制：编译期计算 comptime。读 Zig 代码时你看到的控制流就是真实发生的控制流，这种「所见即所得」的执拗，是理解整门语言的钥匙。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 按四章组织，刻意让难度与抽象层次层层递进，而不是按字母表罗列特性。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」铺设地基。我们先讲清 Zig 的设计哲学——它为什么删掉那么多别的语言视为标配的东西；再过一遍语法骨架，让你能读懂结构体、可选类型与控制流；最后正面攻克 comptime，因为它不是高级话题而是 Zig 的核心，泛型、反射、条件编译全都建立在它之上。</p>\n<p>第二章「内存」是 Zig 最锋利的地方。这里没有垃圾回收，也没有借用检查器，取而代之的是「分配器作为显式参数」这一贯穿全语言的约定。我们依次讲分配器家族、错误处理与 errdefer 的配对清理、以及指针与切片的内存布局。三篇连起来，你就能写出不泄漏、出错也能正确回滚的代码。</p>\n<p>第三章「系统」展示 Zig 作为系统语言的杀手锏：它能无缝吃下 C 头文件，自带一套用 Zig 本身写的构建系统，还能从任意主机一条命令交叉编译到任意目标。很多人最初是被「zig cc」这个开箱即用的交叉编译器吸引过来的。</p>\n<p>第四章「实践」收口。测试是语言内建关键字而非第三方框架，性能来自可预测的零成本抽象，最后一篇把前面所有机制拉到一起，与 Rust 和 C 做一次诚实的横向对比，帮你判断什么场景该选 Zig。</p>\n<p>四条主线——删繁就简的哲学、显式内存、系统亲和、可验证的实践——彼此咬合。读完你会发现 Zig 的「少」不是缺失，而是一种刻意的设计预算。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"zig-philosophy","title":"Zig 设计哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/foundations/zig-philosophy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"syntax-basics","title":"语法基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/foundations/syntax-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"comptime","title":"编译期计算 comptime","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/foundations/comptime"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory","title":"内存","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/memory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"allocators","title":"分配器与显式内存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/memory/allocators"},{"seq":2,"slug":"error-handling","title":"错误处理与 errdefer","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/memory/error-handling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pointers-slices","title":"指针与切片","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/memory/pointers-slices"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"c-interop","title":"C 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/systems/c-interop"},{"seq":2,"slug":"build-system","title":"Zig 构建系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/systems/build-system"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-compilation","title":"交叉编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/systems/cross-compilation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"testing-zig","title":"测试与 comptime 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/practice/testing-zig"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance","title":"性能与零成本抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/practice/performance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"zig-vs-rust-c","title":"Zig 对比 Rust 与 C","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/zig-language/practice/zig-vs-rust-c"}]}]}